sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Browser
    participant Google as Google
    participant API as Backend API
    participant DB as MongoDB
    participant Mail as Mail server

    User->>API: POST /auth/register
    API->>API: Password policy,<br/>breach lookup
    API->>DB: Unverified user,<br/>token hash, 24 h
    API->>Mail: Link with raw token,<br/>max 5/h per address
    API-->>User: 201, session token
    Note over User,API: Browse, like, comment,<br/>but no upload until verified

    alt Follows the link
        User->>API: POST /auth/<br/>verify-email/:token
        API->>DB: Conditional update:<br/>hash, not expired
        API-->>User: 200, verified
    else Google sign-in, same address
        User->>Google: Sign in
        Google-->>User: ID token
        User->>API: POST /auth/google
        API->>Google: Verify ID token
        alt Local account unverified
            API->>DB: Take over: no password,<br/>old tokens revoked
            API-->>User: 200, session token
        else Already verified
            API-->>User: 409 EMAIL_IN_USE
        end
    end
